1:22:02","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"458774","title":"Allcargo Logistics Ltd announces resignation of Mayank Dwivedi, National Head - Sales & Marketing, effective January 29, 2026.\nDwivedi cited personal reasons for his resignation and requested immediate relief from duties despite a 2-month notice period.","summary":"Allcargo Logistics Ltd announces resignation of Mayank Dwivedi, National Head - Sales & Marketing, effective January 29, 2026.\nDwivedi cited personal reasons for his resignation and requested immediate relief from duties despite a 2-month notice period.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=dea559e6-7ba9-40aa-9abe-693f01fc1d05.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-29T16:02:07","source":"BSE"},{"id":"451923","title":"CRISIL downgraded Allcargo Logistics' ratings to 'CRISIL A/CRISIL A2' with a negative outlook, citing weak operating performance and subdued profitability.\nCRISIL also withdrew ratings for Rs. 507 crore term loans due to repayment and Rs. 508 crore bank facilities transferred to Allcargo Global Ltd post demerger.","summary":"CRISIL downgraded Allcargo Logistics' ratings to 'CRISIL A/CRISIL A2' with a negative outlook, citing weak operating performance and subdued profitability.\nCRISIL also withdrew ratings for Rs. 507 crore term loans due to repayment and Rs. 508 crore bank facilities transferred to Allcargo Global Ltd post demerger.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6aa11c5e-13f7-4526-89f4-a64e4719485b.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-23T15:35:19","source":"BSE"},{"id":"797735692638403072","title":"CCI imposes a ₹50 lakh penalty on Allcargo Logistics for alleged non-compliance with Section 6(2) of the Competition Act.\nPenalty pertains to acquisition of stake in Gati Kintetsu Express; Allcargo may consider legal actions.","summary":"CCI imposes a ₹50 lakh penalty on Allcargo Logistics for alleged non-compliance with Section 6(2) of the Competition Act.\nPenalty pertai